values ('e3f4a5b6-7c8d-4e93-8f23-3a4b5c6d7e43', 'european-history-survey', 'European History (Survey)', 'A survey of European history from antiquity and the Middle Ages to the post-1989 era. Students interpret primary sources, connect political, social, cultural, economic, religious, gender, imperial, and intellectual history in one timeline, compare western, eastern, northern, southern, and borderland experiences, and analyze how Europe shaped and was shaped by global exchange, empire, migration, war, and decolonization.');

